{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Бир доңуздун этине,", "text": "Бир доңуздун этине,", "en": "Of the flesh of a single swine,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Жарым курсак болбогон.", "text": "Жарым курсак болбогон.", "en": "He had never even filled half his belly.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Кайраттанып камынып,", "text": "Кайраттанып камынып,", "en": "Gathering courage and making ready,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Кайыптан акыл табылып,", "text": "Кайыптан акыл табылып,", "en": "As if counsel came to him by providence,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Тадамашы Чың Теңир,", "text": "Тадамашы Чың Теңир,", "en": "Chyng Tengir, his chosen commander,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Баргын деп буйрук кылыптыр.", "text": "Баргын деп буйрук кылыптыр.", "en": "Had ordered him to go.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Каны буйрук кылганда,", "text": "Каны буйрук кылганда,", "en": "When his khan gave the command,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Карап Оду турабы,", "text": "Карап Оду турабы,", "en": "Would Odu merely stand and watch?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Одуну кудай урабы,", "text": "Одуну кудай урабы,", "en": "Would God strike Odu down?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Тоодой Коңкул ат минип,", "text": "Тоодой Коңкул ат минип,", "en": "Mounting Kongkul, a horse like a mountain,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Тоо Коңкулдун куйругун,", "text": "Тоо Коңкулдун куйругун,", "en": "The tail of mountain-like Kongkul,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Он эки бөлүп шарт түйүп,", "text": "Он эки бөлүп шарт түйүп,", "en": "He divided into twelve and knotted tight,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Тоодой темир курчанып,", "text": "Тоодой темир курчанып,", "en": "Girding himself in a mountain of iron,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Бул билекке салылуу,", "text": "Бул билекке салылуу,", "en": "Fastened upon this arm,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Жолум үйдөй чоюнбаш,", "text": "Жолум үйдөй чоюнбаш,", "en": "Was a cast-iron mace as large as a house,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Чочуп кетсең оолак кач,", "text": "Чочуп кетсең оолак кач,", "en": "If you take fright, flee far away,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Каардууга кабылсаң,", "text": "Каардууга кабылсаң,", "en": "If you encounter this wrathful one,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Быт-чыт болор кайран баш,", "text": "Быт-чыт болор кайран баш,", "en": "Your precious head will be smashed to pieces,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Коңкул атка камчы уруп,", "text": "Коңкул атка камчы уруп,", "en": "He lashed the horse Kongkul,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Айбаттанды дүркүрөп,", "text": "Айбаттанды дүркүрөп,", "en": "And thundered forth in menace,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Аз гана кыргыз кайран журт,", "text": "Аз гана кыргыз кайран журт,", "en": "The poor, scant Kyrgyz people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Азап боло күркүрөп,", "text": "Азап боло күркүрөп,", "en": "He thundered, bringing them torment,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Кара болот найза алып,", "text": "Кара болот найза алып,", "en": "Taking up a spear of black steel,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Каарданын токтоду,", "text": "Каарданын токтоду,", "en": "His fury would not cease,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Provisional manuscript reading: cursive wording is ambiguous or the row is a manuscript addition without an exact printed counterpart.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Бирөөң турмак бурут журт,", "text": "Бирөөң турмак бурут журт,", "en": "Burut people, not merely one of you,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Бир миң балбан капта деп,", "text": "Бир миң балбан капта деп,", "en": "Let a thousand champions swarm against me,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Кагышсаң какан эл даяр,", "text": "Кагышсаң какан эл даяр,", "en": "If you clash with me, the Kakan host stands ready,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Кан иччү Оду мен даяр,", "text": "Кан иччү Оду мен даяр,", "en": "I, blood-drinking Odu, stand ready,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Баарың мында келгин деп,", "text": "Баарың мында келгин деп,", "en": "“All of you, come here,” he cried,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Майданга чыгып бакырып,", "text": "Майданга чыгып бакырып,", "en": "Striding onto the battlefield and shouting,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Асман, жерди сапырып,", "text": "Асман, жерди сапырып,", "en": "Making heaven and earth churn,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Жаманың коюп шериң кел,", "text": "Жаманың коюп шериң кел,", "en": "Leave your weaklings; send your lion,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf143:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 143, "folio": 526, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Жадаалың ашкан эриң кел,", "text": "Жадаалың ашкан эриң кел,", "en": "Send the warrior whose valor surpasses all,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
